{"id":"494fa4cd0ce92258","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge.md","title":"df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","display":"df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","aliases":["72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge"],"display":"df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-natural-deduction]]","[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §2.1 print341–342/PDF353–354 and Corollary3.2.5 print354/PDF366; explicit basic-arithmetic natural-deduction syntax bridge","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction\">72-df-natural-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §2.1 print341–342/PDF353–354 and Corollary3.2.5 print354/PDF366; explicit basic-arithmetic natural-deduction syntax bridge"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_A=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},a_F,\\{&lt;\\},a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma_A=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},a_F,\\{&lt;\\},a_R\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F(S)=1\">\\(a_F(S)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F(+)=a_F(\\cdot)=2\">\\(a_F(+)=a_F(\\cdot)=2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(&lt;)=2\">\\(a_R(&lt;)=2\\)</span>。取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"72-df-natural-deduction\">72-df-natural-deduction</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_N\">\\(X_N\\)</span> 及实际有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}\">\\(\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}\\)</span>；所有对象变量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\sim A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\ne u:=\\sim(t\\doteq u)\">\\(t\\ne u:=\\sim(t\\doteq u)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A)\\)</span> 按自由变量指标递增作全称闭包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\{A\\in X_N:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\{A\\in X_N:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N,\\operatorname{jud}_N\">\\(Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N,\\operatorname{jud}_N\\)</span> 为同一签名下自然演绎判断与假设函数接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_t,E_f\">\\(E_t,E_f\\)</span> 是到 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a> 的一阶片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 的显式经典翻译；目标里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\lor,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\lor,\\exists\\)</span> 是该语法已给定的宏。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_N\">\\(X_N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_i\">\\(x=v_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 遍历算术项。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\rm qf}\">\\(X_{\\rm qf}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_A\">\\(\\Sigma_A\\)</span> 上的无量词公式集；本节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}[U]&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A):A\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq X_N),\\\\\nB_A:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}[\\{&amp;Sv_0\\ne0,\\ Sv_0\\doteq Sv_1\\to v_0\\doteq v_1,\\ v_0+0\\doteq v_0,\\ v_0+Sv_1\\doteq S(v_0+v_1),\\\\\n&amp;v_0\\cdot0\\doteq0,\\ v_0\\cdot Sv_1\\doteq v_0\\cdot v_1+v_0,\\ \\sim(v_0&lt;0),\\ v_0&lt;Sv_1\\leftrightarrow(v_0&lt;v_1\\lor v_0\\doteq v_1)\\}],\\\\\nI_x(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}((A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall xA),\\\\\n\\mathsf{HA}_{72}&amp;:=B_A\\cup\\{I_x(A):A\\in X_N,x\\in V,\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(Sx,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(t\\doteq t):t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma_A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(t\\doteq u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])):A\\in X_N,\\ t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma_A),\\ x\\in V,\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}[T]&amp;:=\\langle Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N\\cup\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,A):A\\in T\\},\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A})\\rangle,\\\\\nT\\vdash_N A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}[T]\\vdash \\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}[U]&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A):A\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq X_N),\\\\\nB_A:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}[\\{&amp;Sv_0\\ne0,\\ Sv_0\\doteq Sv_1\\to v_0\\doteq v_1,\\ v_0+0\\doteq v_0,\\ v_0+Sv_1\\doteq S(v_0+v_1),\\\\\n&amp;v_0\\cdot0\\doteq0,\\ v_0\\cdot Sv_1\\doteq v_0\\cdot v_1+v_0,\\ \\sim(v_0&lt;0),\\ v_0&lt;Sv_1\\leftrightarrow(v_0&lt;v_1\\lor v_0\\doteq v_1)\\}],\\\\\nI_x(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}((A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall xA),\\\\\n\\mathsf{HA}_{72}&amp;:=B_A\\cup\\{I_x(A):A\\in X_N,x\\in V,\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(Sx,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(t\\doteq t):t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma_A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(t\\doteq u\\to(A[t/x]\\to A[u/x])):A\\in X_N,\\ t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma_A),\\ x\\in V,\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}[T]&amp;:=\\langle Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N\\cup\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,A):A\\in T\\},\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A})\\rangle,\\\\\nT\\vdash_N A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}[T]\\vdash \\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_t(v_i)&amp;:=x_i,\\quad E_t(0):=0,\\quad E_t(St):=S(E_t(t)),\\quad E_t(t+u):=E_t(t)+E_t(u),\\quad E_t(t\\cdot u):=E_t(t)\\cdot E_t(u),\\\\\nE_f(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=(E_t(t)=E_t(u)),\\quad E_f(t&lt;u):=(E_t(t)&lt;E_t(u)),\\\\\nE_f(\\top)&amp;:=(0=0),\\quad E_f(\\bot):=\\neg(0=0),\\\\\nE_f(A\\circ B)&amp;:=E_f(A)\\circ E_f(B)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\nE_f(\\forall v_iA)&amp;:=\\forall x_iE_f(A),\\quad E_f(\\exists v_iA):=\\neg\\forall x_i\\neg E_f(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_t(v_i)&amp;:=x_i,\\quad E_t(0):=0,\\quad E_t(St):=S(E_t(t)),\\quad E_t(t+u):=E_t(t)+E_t(u),\\quad E_t(t\\cdot u):=E_t(t)\\cdot E_t(u),\\\\\nE_f(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=(E_t(t)=E_t(u)),\\quad E_f(t&lt;u):=(E_t(t)&lt;E_t(u)),\\\\\nE_f(\\top)&amp;:=(0=0),\\quad E_f(\\bot):=\\neg(0=0),\\\\\nE_f(A\\circ B)&amp;:=E_f(A)\\circ E_f(B)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\nE_f(\\forall v_iA)&amp;:=\\forall x_iE_f(A),\\quad E_f(\\exists v_iA):=\\neg\\forall x_i\\neg E_f(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Pi^{0,72}_2:=\\{\\forall\\vec x\\exists\\vec y B:\\ &amp;B\\in X_N\\cap X_{\\rm qf},\\ \\vec x,\\vec y\\in V^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n&amp;\\vec x\\frown\\vec y\\textstyle\\in\\{z\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|z|\\ (z_i\\ne z_j)\\},\\ \\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Pi^{0,72}_2:=\\{\\forall\\vec x\\exists\\vec y B:\\ &amp;B\\in X_N\\cap X_{\\rm qf},\\ \\vec x,\\vec y\\in V^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n&amp;\\vec x\\frown\\vec y\\textstyle\\in\\{z\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|z|\\ (z_i\\ne z_j)\\},\\ \\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>HA_72给实际直觉主义算术公理及逻辑相等模式，推导使用有限带解除树；全称闭包都为句子。E_f只用于经典PA侧，不把目标语法里的∃宏搬回NJ当作直觉主义存在。源PA/HA保守性通常按包含PR函数的标准语言陈述；这里给基本算术语言的前束∀∃、无量词矩阵子类。更广有界矩阵版本可经相应保守定义处理，此原子没有将它们字面识别。I_x允许必要改名后的全部归纳实例，不以未解释HA谓词为占位。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-natural-deduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_A=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},a_F,\\{<\\},a_R\\rangle$，$a_F(S)=1$、$a_F(+)=a_F(\\cdot)=2$、$a_R(<)=2$。取 [[72-df-natural-deduction]] 的 $X_N$ 及实际有限 $\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}$；所有对象变量是 $v_i$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E_t,E_f$ 是到 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的一阶片段 $\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)$ 的显式经典翻译；目标里的 $\\land,\\lor,\\exists$ 是该语法已给定的宏。$A,B$ 遍历 $X_N$，$x=v_i$，$t,u$ 遍历算术项。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_{\\rm qf}$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]] 在 $\\Sigma_A$ 上的无量词公式集；本节的 $V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_A=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},a_F,\\{<\\},a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a_F(S)=1","display":false},{"tex":"a_F(+)=a_F(\\cdot)=2","display":false},{"tex":"a_R(<)=2","display":false},{"tex":"X_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim A:=A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\ne u:=\\sim(t\\doteq u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{72}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\{A\\in X_N:\\operato