t(t)),\\quad E_t(t+u):=E_t(t)+E_t(u),\\quad E_t(t\\cdot u):=E_t(t)\\cdot E_t(u),\\\\\nE_f(t\\doteq u)&:=(E_t(t)=E_t(u)),\\quad E_f(t<u):=(E_t(t)<E_t(u)),\\\\\nE_f(\\top)&:=(0=0),\\quad E_f(\\bot):=\\neg(0=0),\\\\\nE_f(A\\circ B)&:=E_f(A)\\circ E_f(B)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\nE_f(\\forall v_iA)&:=\\forall x_iE_f(A),\\quad E_f(\\exists v_iA):=\\neg\\forall x_i\\neg E_f(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Pi^{0,72}_2:=\\{\\forall\\vec x\\exists\\vec y B:\\ &B\\in X_N\\cap X_{\\rm qf},\\ \\vec x,\\vec y\\in V^{<\\omega},\\\\\n&\\vec x\\frown\\vec y\\textstyle\\in\\{z\\in V^{<\\omega}:\\forall i<j<|z|\\ (z_i\\ne z_j)\\},\\ \\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4316,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d84a32e163edd84","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PA}$、数语法 $\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)$ 与 $\\operatorname{ucl}$ 如 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]。$\\Sigma_A$ 是 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]] 的五元数签名；目标使用core的 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_A)$ 与LK序列相继式。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge|df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]"},{"id":"ca4d81197c96530e","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi^1_1,\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing),\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的实际句法类。$\\mathsf{HA}_{72},\\vdash_N,E_f,\\Pi^{0,72}_2$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]] 的独立直觉主义语法及经典翻译。"},{"id":"cdd1728c22275ffc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{HA}_{72}$、算术语言、$X_N,V,\\operatorname{FV}_{72}$ 及 $\\vdash_N$ 使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]；$\\overline0=0$、$\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n$。$A,B,C,D\\in X_N$，$x,y\\in V$，$B,C$ 为闭句，$\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}$，$\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(D)\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}$ 且 $x\\ne y$；代入均采用该语法的 $[-/-]$ 运算，显示数码都是闭项。"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8","4c916f34e9cc3391","5ae195683ce3beb4"]}